cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RootArch: an open-source Python pipeline for full-stack root architecture phenotyping"
message: >-
  If you use this software in research, please cite both the software (this
  CITATION.cff) and identify the version used. The accompanying manuscript is a draft.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: 清芸
    family-names: 唐
    affiliation: "石河子大学农学院；新疆农垦科学院"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
keywords:
  - "root system architecture"
  - "image analysis pipeline"
  - "fractal dimension"
  - "multifractal spectrum"
  - "Strahler topology"
  - "open-source plant phenotyping"
  - "functional-structural plant modeling"
abstract: >-
  Root Architecture V1.0.0 quantifies image geometry and candidate root topology
  with explicit calibration provenance, crossing reconstruction, and an optional
  shared-crown model. Dense overlap and fragmented real-root images require
  review; this software release does not establish biological ground truth.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-15"
